    "mitigation": "Validate every Chainlink round before using it as a fallback: require answer > 0, updatedAt != 0, updatedAt <= block.timestamp, answeredInRound >= roundId, and block.timestamp - updatedAt <= a configured maximum age. For quote-relative prices, validate both the base and quote feeds and mark the oracle state infeasible if either feed fails validation. Ensure WooPP swaps reject an invalid fallback rather than treating any nonzero answer as feasible.",
    "severity": "High"
  }
